#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid "WP Branches For Post"
msgstr "WP Branches For Post"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid "https://github.com/hsxk/WP-Branches-For-Post/"
msgstr "https://github.com/hsxk/WP-Branches-For-Post/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid ""
"Create safe working branches for published WordPress content and merge them "
"back without changing the public post while editing."
msgstr ""
"公開済みの WordPress コンテンツに安全な作業用ブランチを作成し、編集中は公開中"
"の投稿を変更せず、作業完了後に変更内容を元の投稿へマージできます。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: post-branch.php
msgid "Hao Kexin"
msgstr "Hao Kexin"

#. Author URI of the plugin
